    doctor, dietitian, or other qualified professional about your own health. Product reviews reflect
    our own editorial evaluation (see <a href="/our-method">Our Method</a>) and are not a guarantee of
    fitness for any particular purpose.
  </p>

  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>
    This site contains affiliate links and earns a commission on qualifying purchases, disclosed in
    full on the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">affiliate disclosure</a> page. Using an affiliate link
    does not change the price you pay.
  </p>

  <h2>No warranty</h2>
  <p>
    This site is provided "as is." We make a genuine effort to keep every factual claim accurate and
    sourced, but we don't warrant that the site is error-free, uninterrupted, or that any product
    recommendation is suitable for your specific circumstances. Research gets superseded; we correct
