    Original text and analysis on this site is ours. Cited studies, images, and data belong to their
    original publishers and are referenced under fair use for commentary and citation purposes. Product
    images belong to their respective manufacturers or retailers.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms as the site changes. Continued use after an update means you accept the
    revised terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    <a href="mailto:hello@thehydrationcode.com">hello@thehydrationcode.com</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
